          "text": "At #BharatSummit2025 🇮🇳, 100+ Progressive Alliance parties, associate members, and guests gathered with @INCIndia to advance a shared agenda for justice, democracy, and solidarity.\n\nOver two days:\n🔹 Panels tackled global challenges across continents.\n🔹 The Board set 2025 priorities: regional exchanges, peacebuilding, and advancing women’s leadership and gender justice.\n🔹 Adopted the Declaration to defend democracy, build inclusive economies, forge peace, and counter disinformation.\n🔹 Passed the Nicaragua resolution + consolidated 3-year regional action plans.\n\nWe concluded with the launch of the Hyderabad Declaration alongside leaders from all regions. 🌍\n\n#DeliveringGlobalJustice"
